The PX13 DSPs select left/right from a shared stereo stream. Keep both
channels on each SoundWire port instead of splitting them in hw_params.

The firmware's SDCA init tables are not parsed, so the fallback initializes
both amps with DSP posture 1 (left). Select posture 4 for the right amp after
every fallback initialization, including SoundWire reattach on resume.
Leave firmware-provided init tables alone when available.

Posture/address mapping verified on the same HN7306EAC hardware:
https://github.com/Salamandsome/ASUS-ProArt-PX13-Audio-Fix/blob/main/docs/analysis.md

--- a/tas2783-sdw.c
+++ b/tas2783-sdw.c
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
